INSERT INTO `f7i9_policy_pages` (`id`, `title`, `content`) VALUES
(1, 'Privacy Policy', '<p>Privacy Policy</p>\r\n'),
(2, 'Terms & Condition', '<p>Welcome to Future India Exports Pushkar (&ldquo;Company,&rdquo; &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;). These Terms &amp; Conditions (&ldquo;Terms&rdquo;) govern your access to and use of our website futureindiaexpo.com<br />\r\n&nbsp;(&ldquo;Website&rdquo;) and our services, including the purchase of products. By accessing or using our Website, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, please refrain from using our Website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. General Information</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Future India Exports Pushkar is a manufacturer, exporter, and wholesaler of garments, fabrics, and garment accessories.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All products displayed on our Website are subject to availability and may be modified, updated, or discontinued at our discretion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Account Registration</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Guest users may browse limited products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Registered accounts have access to 1,000+ products and features such as multi-currency pricing (EUR, USD, INR, GBP, AUD).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. Any activity under your account will be deemed your responsibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. Orders &amp; Pricing</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>All prices are displayed in your selected currency; however, final billing may vary based on exchange rates, taxes, and applicable duties.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any order due to pricing errors, stock unavailability, or fraudulent activity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wholesale orders must meet the minimum purchase requirements as mentioned on our Website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Payments</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Payments must be made through the approved payment methods listed on the Website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All transactions are secure and processed in compliance with international payment standards.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Customers are responsible for any applicable bank charges or transfer fees.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. Shipping &amp; Delivery</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide worldwide shipping from India.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Delivery timelines depend on the destination country and shipping method chosen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Customs duties, taxes, and import regulations are the responsibility of the buyer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not liable for delays caused by customs clearance, courier services, or unforeseen events.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>6. Intellectual Property</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>All content on futureindiaexpo.com, including text, images, logos, and product designs, is the intellectual property of Future India Exports Pushkar and may not be copied, reproduced, or distributed without written consent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>7. Limitation of Liability</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We strive to provide accurate product details and reliable service; however, we do not guarantee error-free operation of the Website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our Website or products.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>8. Privacy Policy</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>By using our Website, you agree to our data collection and usage practices as outlined in our Privacy Policy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>9. Governing Law &amp; Jurisdiction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Pushkar, Rajasthan, India.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>10. Changes to Terms</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Future India Exports Pushkar reserves the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Updates will be effective upon posting on the Website.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>11. Contact Us</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>For any questions or concerns about these Terms &amp; Conditions, please contact us:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📧 Email: futureindia1987@gmail.com<br />\r\n📞 Phone: 9680682068, 6367262201<br />\r\n🌐 Website: futureindia